## Inspect No-Retraining Diagnostic Artifacts

The runner writes these alongside the main results:

```text
prediction_mode_comparison.jsonl  # sample/mean x autoregressive/teacher-forced
prediction_mode_p50.png           # typical per-horizon failures
prediction_mode_p99.png           # tail per-horizon failures
calibration_by_horizon.png        # coverage, Mahalanobis error, and Gaussian scale
distribution_audit.json           # selected train-versus-validation feature shifts
```

The Gaussian mean is used only as a diagnostic. The official benchmark remains
sampled because the model defines future trajectories through its bivariate
Gaussian outputs.

```python {"interpreter":"/home/splion/Desktop/personal/interpreting-social-navigation/.venv/bin/python"}
